      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems like with such cpu feature checks we expose implementation details that should be hidden inside patch_retpoline() and patch_return()... Maybe we can just call patch_pkvm() unconditionally, without these checks?",
      "revId": "db87712061595251a8a61fc3c333b17b2119a2e9",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
